WEBVTT

00:00:00.352 --> 00:00:11.152
Before the fix. The owner has a change staged in the main checkout, to a file this card changes too. Approving fails, and the toast says the card offers to fold the change in.

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:21.352
But the card only reads Demo ready, or Ready for review, and offers nothing. Staged changes were not counted, and the white toast had no way back to the card.

00:00:22.319 --> 00:00:35.999
Now with the fix. The same approval fails the same way, but the toast is a yellow warning that stays, with a Go to card button. The card turns orange, reads Not landed, file conflict, and counts in Needs you.

00:00:36.951 --> 00:00:48.471
Go to card opens it. The staged file is named, with Fold in and land, or Fold in with a new demo. Folding moves the staged version into the card for its agent to work in.
